@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：重试耗尽后的结果映射

actor Caller
participant MessageTemplate as Template
participant DefaultReliableMessageSender as Sender
participant RetryExecutor as Retry
participant MessageProvider as Provider
participant MessageSendRetryClassifier as Classifier

Caller -> Template: send()
Template -> Sender: send(prepared)
Sender -> Retry: execute(maxAttempts = 3)

loop attempt 1..3
  Retry -> Sender: execute attempt
  Sender -> Provider: provider.send(request)
  Provider --> Sender: ProviderSendResult.FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR
  Retry -> Classifier: classify(FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR)
  Classifier --> Retry: RETRY
  Retry -> Retry: backoff if next attempt allowed
end

Retry --> Sender: RetryResult.EXHAUSTED(attempts=3)

alt last ProviderSendResult = FAILED
  Sender --> Template: SendResult.FAILED + RETRY_EXHAUSTED
  Template --> Caller: FAILED
else last ProviderSendResult = UNKNOWN
  Sender --> Template: SendResult.UNKNOWN + RETRY_EXHAUSTED
  Template --> Caller: UNKNOWN
end

note over Sender
RETRY_EXHAUSTED 是失败原因，不是 SendStatus。
如果最后一次结果未知，最终仍保守返回 UNKNOWN。
end note
@enduml
